Steam login and the Steam relay transport use the steamworks crate (MIT or Apache-2.0) and Valve's
steam_api64.dll, a Steamworks SDK redistributable (Copyright (c) 1996-2026 Valve Corporation). The DLL is not in
this repository; the build copies it next to redex.exe. Its terms, what may and may not be shipped, and the
game-server libraries are recorded in crates/redex-world/NOTICE.

The puppets' movement (src/x/puppet.rs: `walk`, `speed`, the stand/walk/run motion choice, the object ids from
0x8000, the free slots left to the game) follows the field avatars of eidos (https://github.com/Project-Holon/eidos,
sdk/mod_avatar.c and docs/mod-coop.md, commit 83861d3), under the MIT License:

